ferroc — Ferrum + Commander
===========================

Independent Rust agent/core reimplementation based on the public protocol and
behavioral contracts of Better Remote Commander:
https://github.com/shahidx0x/better-remote-commander
Pinned source: cbe511702dd0147650353c29ac6ab1decd8afda1
Copyright (c) 2026 Better Remote Commander contributors (MIT).

BRC's tool core is derived from Desktop Commander MCP:
https://github.com/wonderwhy-er/DesktopCommanderMCP
Copyright (c) 2024-2025 Eduard Ruzga and Desktop Commander Contributors (MIT).

Reference snapshots in docs/upstream/ were obtained with GitHub MCP at the pinned
revision. They are source evidence, not executed or shipped as a Node runtime.
The original TypeScript repository remains separate from the Rust implementation.

The optional Node scripts scripts/upstream-e2e.mjs and
scripts/gui-http-sdk-probe.mjs are test drivers using a separate canonical relay
checkout/MCP SDK; ferroc itself is native Rust and has no Node runtime.

The optional Windows GUI uses published WindUI 0.32.0:
https://github.com/huanfeng/wind-ui-rust
